        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your grandfather left you a pig and an old vat as an inheritance. Take care of the cute pigs, wash them and protect them from wolves and other dangers.<br>Hmm, your grandfather also left you a letter that mentions treasures...<br>Maybe you and the pigs will be able to find them?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take care of the pigs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed them, love them and wash them.<br>If the pig is happy, it can dig up coins for you or even find treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913550/extras/d635260bab40a2c3dc03aec0ad0da3de.poster.avif?t=1756203490\" width=400 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913550/extras/d635260bab40a2c3dc03aec0ad0da3de.webm?t=1756203490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913550/extras/d635260bab40a2c3dc03aec0ad0da3de.mp4?t=1756203490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buy new bathtubs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each type of bathtub has its own unique process for washing the pig.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam the pig with a broom, use a hose for washing or bubbles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913550/extras/0b9ad85ff493f53844da7ab4027c0df0.poster.avif?t=1756203490\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913550/extras/0b9ad85ff493f53844da7ab4027c0df0.webm?t=1756203490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913550/extras/0b9ad85ff493f53844da7ab4027c0df0.mp4?t=1756203490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Protect from dangers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pigs are too valuable in this world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wolves are trying to drag them away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UFOs are subject to abduction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913550/extras/ed479a3f3cb4e820af04752536aae336.poster.avif?t=1756203490\" width=500 height=108 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913550/extras/ed479a3f3cb4e820af04752536aae336.webm?t=1756203490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913550/extras/ed479a3f3cb4e820af04752536aae336.mp4?t=1756203490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lots of upgrade options</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy new pigs, put hats on them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy vats and more beautiful bathtubs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate the area where the pigs are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913550/extras/a0dc247684399b1ccb0f87885bcc7f03.poster.avif?t=1756203490\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913550/extras/a0dc247684399b1ccb0f87885bcc7f03.webm?t=1756203490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913550/extras/a0dc247684399b1ccb0f87885bcc7f03.mp4?t=1756203490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game layout and scale</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the layout and scale of the game to suit your needs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913550/extras/9694c91f7ce56a5c05fadd91929cb901.poster.avif?t=1756203490\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913550/extras/9694c91f7ce56a5c05fadd91929cb901.webm?t=1756203490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913550/extras/9694c91f7ce56a5c05fadd91929cb901.mp4?t=1756203490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
